{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1466,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd611df4cb98ba013438723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要和妈妈去夜间泳池了。\r\n该怎么办呢——\r\n要穿什么泳衣去呢？呀~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "38a20063315d1500f692dda677a347cfa2f6c3c0d903e996f44e7da9be029479",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2ff7c2cfd72c503c6cd29be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说在迪拜能看到很棒的艺术。\r\n不觉得很适合艺术之秋这个词吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "20a9fb97912361c3f2aa5408082fc9ca1a175778c252d4cd4bb03eb0e3c1bf51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b9c3a0e80913ed83ef089e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "买到冬季化妆品啦~！\r\n说不定会变身成冷酷美少女呢！\r\n敬请期待哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa3138e4abf78965dcce34b56da441f5cd3230da6ec4f6b6052b568ce00080b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd2a9db66655712f205d13e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好—！训练员亲今天的\n闪闪发光程度是多少呢？\n我的话~达到了120%呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5222d229d0139d5bb7e14994c8e6c3b25746159ecb516539a4e222c9cf025422",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8bdccf3705051cc28f01ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次把头发放下来\n都会抹上足量的护发油呢。\n看这柔顺的样子很漂亮吧~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88def6ef1f62131761b2c999cfcfda80f7d4775c4f619ae960d9da04e0a9c9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d739fdc4b7c88369e14bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的下午茶就吃芒果刨冰\n来品味南方风情吧♪\n训练员亲要来试试吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2049e4dd46dca6f98d4fb815abe403edf5e5ad896a35c7c551cfd04923beb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4106e1e7ab8c37cab5f82f86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hi, handsome!说说看而已~♪\n为了将来能在海外过上名流生活\n我努力学了英语呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9b1d449712d223a727aefecd9bc93b0ce4725e43fcb6406678afe7398382a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e900e3ca3a73a056737581b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的晚安香薰点那款好呢~？\n回去找救主同学商量一下好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93ecadd60967452f2c67d6724e006d146e6d9d8560e5a8ebe8496e6f2a4164c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9a0901b006e4cd26fa575d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近迷上了海外电视剧！\n危险的恋情走向真充满了戏剧性\n真的是~~……太让人惊心动魄了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c00d88d29c970d5d3b6a0624f2b271b6add9081aea1f769c02776119708753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c2100364e70b056a1097bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配合衣服上的花花，\n香水也都是用的花香味♪\n这样比平时华丽多了对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "402c25c811c4bd6b5b9f1d048de4a00e1b66e330065c2cfc747996df37e3861d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e67b09a941eb930ffaffa43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发也要做好防晒。\n得好好养护角质层，\n保持柔顺光泽才行呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa7a35a37bca95a32990d6ca7119478b90121f15a52d0b6e7e890e6ebececf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490dbfd3ac4d301c7f54e905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节泡温泉会很舒服呢♪\n好想包一栋带露天浴池的别墅~\n最好再配个专属管家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5546d58174fdfa0a700340353dd436fa1c801aa39c2dee30b2530c3bef1b74d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc43859d3a7e0a264916944",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瑟瑟发抖……呐训练员亲，\n今天去温水泳池训练行吗？\n把寒冷的日子变得像南方一样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b05c27807efe148df00eed4bb4cc17480e2b0c0896a15fabfd0c705dd6423f8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da349a8f2fd3f868663df992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7f9512bd133e742131f60f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56544469973b5dde10c02661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hi, gorgeous!说说看而已~♪\n为了将来能在海外过上名流生活\n我努力学了英语呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5438d3d91236a70906ab16442fd676cf8a4ad7a0aa1e58aa5cc7880e947e7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59852bbe3133128f1378652b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要想了解最新潮流的话，\r\n果然还是得找皇冠！\r\n她知道很多上流的情报很厉害的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb81e37bc0c1b44b6c36725555eefaf81326b2169a852ca9e1c03308f750d579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974f9642888ac1f6916eb809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "香港也不错啊。\r\n有很多高高的建筑，夜景也很漂亮！\r\n在高塔上干杯什么的，真想试试啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3591be2926106619e3565b2799ae9b337da72eb8c0f3d11f2906cc54a14d0fd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36033c0b2e1622556f94d565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后要在小钻亲的豪华轿车上\r\n开女子会。要带些什么点心去呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d45fa53597e3ba4c2ab02f49d924b08746b978e6cfe3b41d6b666927b83397f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ed682849e6bd836a4abe59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行上流的新闻检查☆\r\n嗯~♪好莱坞演员的恋爱什么的~\r\n太有派头，太刺激了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb927f6b26c2ba3db2479950e1790b191011be8dfa925184d096ef2eac8b935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4702937e3fe7d31672b2917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然争鸣同学总是会表扬我，\r\n但是偶尔也会露出认真的眼神……\r\n这时就……呀~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6644b1c6f6b45ad7017a8cddeb7991789267e823a6ffad27c6d26b8cd2c8e0af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f5b80dfe86f78bc7e579ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞的话我很拿手的。\r\n毕竟每次受邀参加名流的派对\r\n都免不了要跳舞啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e91a86394b31160ebd729aeaf49d1fb30b7a1b47d0dbad4aa5fd7cfc7fa3a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db156be94729e7265961f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望你能在Live上多多鼓掌呢☆\r\n我会偷偷地只和训练员亲进行\r\n眼神交流的♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade76302d2e041457d7f47d6694d45003ccfe58300fbc211bdb633536fb3aa53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5d3ebf960299777c13aade9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想象一下！\r\n在国外的海边蓝色披风随风飘扬！\r\n超浪漫的不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4211665a4aab59413889b694c8da000d7bfffc54a5a66713c7939c6a96d4a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd9eba4ccb6ceb37ef712c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待会要去坐邮轮吗？\r\n这个装束的话，无论和什么样的大海\r\n都很搭吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa0500269307ab5246b24735d2bc3bfcf7f1a9b7e450dce5c92066f81c702b96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c54fb3707f4c9c9205268c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上泡澡真舒服啊~\r\n可以以皮肤光滑的状态\r\n开始新的一天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "891e8084a9d2e7cef6b8afb1b78070c20c483bb83c56483708bff35b5e3a17a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb03d6eb0739e1c9470ec5a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真模式期间找大鸣大放前辈\r\n商量了午餐。营养搭配什么的\r\n都介绍的很详细，真可靠啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e530f8a0aed53a233cfdec5d6dd6c92f6fb7860215777005d2b929c7b0dcd15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1a36fdb21d3ca28532a6993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——呀！！？\r\n刚刚，是不是有什么声音！！？\r\n…是、是风吗……？真的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "311203ce74e8cbbe6ce9b139411acbdc7ae04052fb1901f2ad3179c3f4b127ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270de11cb3c8409948dbf9f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呐，来闻一下看看！\r\n有花的香味对吧？\r\n我用了很有春天感的香水呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f0a0c26fefb4ffed5f88ca41c5c66ecf9b1bee8098a39a2811dfb852538df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:657cbc1e26b1f7cb3c4d90c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这段时期的大海很美丽！也就是说，\r\n是和骏逸亲一起钓鱼的好季节！\r\n好，去约她吧~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eb0ef8e69d5ca3ee46f299b623f103d0409cc87aa3243b68aff3c55a7a993a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728d97902a6088f69fdbebee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近天气好干燥啊。\r\n得好好保养保持皮肤光滑才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c814a1fcda740eef438621934ad987225b40678db5ea23a08c8c03eb2ceacc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b4c96bf0c9c32e051deb4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？不冷哦？从以前开始\r\n就是这样了。难道说你在考虑\r\n为我取暖的方法吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1f977b8013ab6776223c124bd2ea062ca8965579ed7d2aa65d58ff9d9a0889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3691815063886c0df439f068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说杏目同学对迪拜很熟悉呢！\n那里的地理、礼仪还有语言\n她都很了解。我要向她学习~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43264231888888dd4dfab915921d25a9ff35f3d372787d974218446f00edecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af85eafdbd66069bdb4c3e2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐教了我烫卷发的技巧☆\n要点是，注意别烫伤发根！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b0498f19c3ba224492d1bad6e5907114c2d39ca826a10d0df06b85cc3e273d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240844a9000793a2a14168d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去度假村的话，\n晚餐时穿的礼服已经有了~……\n高跟鞋、首饰和包包也想配齐呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb478cd0d016908e0711206d04b5d97f9fbee2a9df45dfbabd4a019606c3720d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c3fa7f1f68e9c672adfe4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外卖吃撑的时候骏逸亲超~靠谱的！\n会说出『交给我吧』这样的话呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de9a8a5cbdcaf13c87065e49733b725309eb4a45f87f1a81ac9829ce79e3cf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366ebc08df5f5a0fa9605ab7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皇冠要我们以后要来度假村呢♪\n下次得把姐姐也叫上~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc5d8ac2b45061553e0d2067c73fa39e0788d9fbc4d6de8a6b941aaf81a0ad4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64df080159635609c805634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天梦见了自己坐头等舱去旅行♪\n总有一天要让它变成真的~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eab717cea22e1311b813a39b647b06353f59a4dc861413c300f82b1146ff467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a50043a9f09bcab0e7453a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了下次取材\n得好好考虑一下拍照姿势呢~\n呐训练员亲，可以帮我拍拍照吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f10da9b242104dcb5d0b0d560e59841292edc0c1018a3c1d98423b7b8de01ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f7e3f7d682588114c74f530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和妈妈打完电话后\n就变得很想见她了……啊~啊，\n要是有私人飞机就能马上见到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc538cd3bdf9f06a169185ebb2ef4ad9b94e0f78baae2f19e60d006fd44d0d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d576b4ba15494c5e6475ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光暖暖的，真是约会的好天气啊♪\n要不去塔顶吃绝景午餐怎么样~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bf40ec886db71cb4588826f98523a8361d0eababbf5d859798766610a68535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c9c4ad80353c2200d30cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训我也会带上这身泳装哦！\n沙滩漫步，还有海边咖啡厅打卡，\n一起好好享受吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6a1ce060318d942973f17623d51a06977c2ae2e3cbcadd0fae2d41c8969e51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40803c06d2c35a8173575690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天时我们家会经常\n一起去兜风赏红叶呢~\n爸爸开车时的样子真的很帅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "85021468acfc26fad4b9e430a4a9a341c481c3ba13a344f047c4fc463b0680e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a15fadc411d2baa3e4f4b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的度假村也很棒呢！\n在休息室边看雪边喝茶，\n简直棒到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d9aab062d18000b8eb8bbd6687f95510748592cd634849ad22e5bd3ecab3a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477a49bbb97c4f1eb859ba9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢蓝色，\n不过粉色也超可爱的啊。\n能让人变得悸动不已☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bbd2fb566d23e514f796af9e9803abab836fe4b303e6b28fe8fb7c2e2f7f8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fb8f4d4e221e49b8b1daee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说想做同款美甲，结果得到回复\n说“只做脚趾甲的话没问题”♪\n欸嘿嘿，像是骏逸亲会说的话呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3723e8b878e7ff881f8d47630c1119dfa77f81ae2c9b3c4641cc8cbed06d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cf428ad429c84d5a622b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是受到表扬就能成长的类型！\r\n要让我不断成长哦~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd336ee5990e758d54b3813b08d5ab80aea558f0720dad68447dbf2889ed6ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8ff45fb9b15bc0f4dc1aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfd32d5490b4253760f7861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练菜单，\r\n为我考虑了很多吧？\r\n让我看看让我看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f14ff0dba3766751ebd6793d5a139917aa7c819ca7744fa84a42fd1a452aa9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ad53d9dd25ada8f0f0ac3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断成长中☆\r\n希望目光别从我身上离开呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da965bcacbc3abad7fbe1e99a93f3e89346d4b2abb2161c0a22be9420e56dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5218a81c3df415fd73a728bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐们也一定正在努力吧。\r\n我也不会输的~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c19e0c436fca2fb76f463d73e2fb50bf6806b2116295188af85e6d530daa631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c262e117b8bee0ac4cd7993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的奖励会是什么呢~\r\n是开心的事？还是好吃的东西？\r\n我很期待，多多关照啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34da454e278e8a8f6db421c00528d66a3f90a33ad3fa1797aff2ddabee26efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105e88b788a7b7592a983f68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，训练结束后有预定吗？\r\n我想去看看衣服。\r\n拜托了，我想和训练员亲一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b4ad2875b8f04b8daf271b06a1c34e2c5ac4f1db331b2d573295a3cdc95d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc42a8686749925e7ec62218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去了迪拜后该做什么呢！\r\n参赛自然是不用说，\r\n也想享受两个人的私人时光呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "29136f336a2750a35bbfbf82f017d3aad9817098c521caa3d98429ca78424653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535276a041e67ee10632607f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝色的大海，白色的沙滩！\r\n这样的景色就像在度假胜地一样，\r\n我太喜欢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea85abea1b01937aea91f6a97d839861c94b73d46e23a1796f03a10759b600c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ff442920ee3244920fd6c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！\n防晒霜也仔细涂上了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "56d231351f5c36ca74d3ea7dc875097cb14ffba05d083f34564ea0355fe9704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ea680f7ec83ac418e8b64c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了享受上流的假期，\n现在得好好努力，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "526940e7b0a6399b020725eb82e9df9d407796fc9e8b0fa4776f7ce194bd5e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5878cfc89f9b17a4da44cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时候，\n也想尽量享受其中乐趣呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d479f61c03f5c938c5a1278c5e11bdfdd9ad46d44c73590f2c3f3e4c82b6d915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ef38a282aa582f6f899b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐说锻炼精神也很重要……\n呜呜，铁球训练什么的\n还是不要啦~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2815e54402e2d3eec129262ac221f5f6272d3c1d82a168ec3172c0f73cfe69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b5d582671fea3bcbbd6acdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~呐~来制定一下今天训练后的\n安排吧！是去吃东西？\n还是去购物？该选哪个呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "231c90f9f6c74dd63e2ba25dfac13e392af3b3915cd9a3ef60e92b423b558e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d241eb2e100a607bfdcec0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有很多地方想和训练员亲\n一起去呢！\n你会和我一起去的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb6345d054e7dc162f066c0c1217fd8fe436eb6badb7cb85b469e36c1dda15c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebac1762972798ffafe7ec16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的西装吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb776f62d85db15dbc81bb035de01a2858c65d1a864b74b7c5b4fbc725a159e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5af9339d08f19247a6f24cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的礼服吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c98ad9d9f337f21922eb79c18c9dbaff3cc712e4c482ffa30d4cb7f44aec6f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644146b3f80820016b3029ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害吧！\r\n已经变得这么闪耀了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0be88dfb2508738f121715539d468cbd86ddd87e6eba80703d77b4a4aa11932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef163c80b02c7312c79c52f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲努力了，奖励你一朵小花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e73a9414766e4c019c85c3ce2530cbad43b76f2d541c472f37e1bd07a9fc30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e45c9eecc278ec92e2343cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起享受了最棒的假期呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5635e62a12eb8fcc0e803f558dd9ff0c9c01666973d0eab83522dca6660359e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910639fda73f94a4358356a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是短暂却开心的旅程呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2850bef6115b6d102d0d9aafae49cfdcf420f021174aaf4dd8c053de9d24fa1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:518021a35b8e59ba12de5a54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f1643b977624337bc997a7a630078d4d06abec8324c77bd047a6f069e3f41c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86564c72ea86cc322ef15cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悸动停不下来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb1fbe129b41f9ec7bc17ea4c6cfb7c027b678d55c2f8e3da013b2c3aef80e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c556240c495a2742d63eb12c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击！\r\n一起好好相处吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac40d8f92457fcecd88c01e1446206e2cd29ad404863157afaa0b18a0c929e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a31d4e60522bbfd016307b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为闪闪发光的名流！\r\n和我一起悸动吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68da2898ecbe3e872b21884b37137c29c113ec894feeee21eac92f33e86d8ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49e04dd33eeefa6925013d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会多多帮忙的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bb89a9e775aa3c63aa7e40dac93216ce37bfdcc6897425dc966271b0bdcb63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9698c03a58675d57355b5df2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种事我也能办到哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08811e02a2daf88b7cd849c899e5b53371bdbbdc97a911557169df158d2e8a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4396cfa2efc27a3fca7c81af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名流等级，上升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25dcf47ceffd919fe8f504f286aff576add8d9bfd8be516a1c95fd168cd8b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df8a9a533d1d3f0a1b19222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更更更闪耀了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdc5590f9b249f46123503260352d4a087d940aab0e506b6048430fc3127938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af934087e5de75a228921d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的我变身☆\n一起好好享受假期吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "920aba012cd0a6a2897805236974928319685a7537fc4f1f32d66082ab417793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7cae817c839f87868ff686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！\n带着度假的心情出发吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f321bc396dff3247d1f2d5d052500cd5cee5bb1d82bfd2f5dc7a8fdd65ecdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f950e6d8f1e490a3d24919e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "は～い、手伝いますね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5858d1bba5d33613f57fc5195336a04bc19d83fa77f7c59a49b0654c63011e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e269c64ea2b15d97d238d39a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしだっていつか主役に――なんて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "920a3fb56645c90510bba822522982159501386b0ebfaa40a02c86b5efa62107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af386d25218c8ad935cae8ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『安全でクリーンな実験だよ～！』\r\n…こ、こうかな？タキオンちゃんの\r\nおねだりどおりに宣伝できてる…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e5fc944cc5c7c135739533f4daf102e6776f18b55d70758d5941a8c8055de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
